'''Dark Dober''' (ドヴェルダーク, ''Doveru Dāku'', '''Dover Dark''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[Dober P.D]] introduced in [[Konjac Valley]]. It was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

{{Enemy Info
