|image = E 682.png
|first appearance ='''ZL''': [[One-Second Photo|Sub-chapter 11 - One-Second Photo]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Cluttered Calligraphy|Sub-chapter 30 - Cluttered Calligraphy]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
This Dober variant is very dangerous, with very high health and DPS, slightly more range, an Omni Strike that pierces up to 350 range, and a guaranteed chance to weaken units to 25% for 2 seconds. Its [[Mini-Wave]]s are comparatively less threatening due to their lower damage, as they primarily serve to expand its Weaken ability. The icing on the cake is that Dark Dober is a Sage, meaning despite its exploitable trait, all crowd-control specialists other than [[:Category:Sage Slayer Cats|Sage Slayers]] will be unable to properly impede it. Fortunately, it is kept in check by its six knockbacks.

==Strategy==
While [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] is generally ineffective, a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] can be invaluable against Dark Dober due to being [[Strong Against|Strong]] against Dark and immune to Weaken, while also having enough health to survive several hits if well-invested. However, Dark Dober has an Omni Strike that allows its to easily weaken any unit within its reach, so its piercing can become deadly under certain circumstances.

As far as [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] go, any backliner that's Immune to Waves, or Weaken, is a valuable asset. Without its main crowd-controlling gimmick, this canine is much weaker than its [[St. Dober|angelic counterpart]]. Additionally, rushers with high burst damage are good to take advantage of his high knockback count to land multiple attacks, provided they're timed well-enough to not be sniped by Dark Dober's Mini-Waves.

Dark Dober still keeps the weakness of its original form, though: it has pretty low base range. Abusing this is almost necessary to take it down. Most [[:Category:Backliner-class Cats|backliners]] will be able to do the job, but those with immunity to Waves/Weaken will be more useful.

Overall, this enemy is not to be underestimated in any way, shape, or form. Dispose of it as quickly as possible.

